== Notes ==
*The Skeletal Dragon cannot be mounted with the [[Skyrim:Bend Will|Bend Will]] shout.{{DB}}
*If you disengage from combat with the Skeletal Dragon and are no longer detected, its health will instantly regenerate. This is because its health regenerates more than {{hover|15% per second compared to 0.7% per second|20x faster}} than a regular dragon outside of combat.
*A Skeletal Dragon also [[Legends:Skeletal Dragon|appears]] in the [[Legends:Heroes of Skyrim|Heroes of Skyrim]] card expansion for ''[[LG:Legends|Legends]]''. [[Online:Bone Dragon|Bone Dragon]]s appear in [[ESO:Online|ESO]], while [[Blades:Undead Dragon|Undead Dragon]]s appear in ''[[Blades:Blades|Blades]]''.
*The Skeletal Dragon in Labyrinthian is one of the only three instances the player can interact with and fight a dragon prior to completing [[Skyrim:Dragon Rising|Dragon Rising]] with the others being [[Skyrim:Durnehviir (dragon)|Durnehviir]] and [[Skyrim:Vulthuryol|Vulthuryol]]